---
import { coursePath, siteData, sitePath } from '../lib/site-data';

const availableRate = Math.round(
  (siteData.stats.coursesWithResources / siteData.stats.courses) * 100,
);
const topCourses = [...siteData.courses]
  .filter((course) => course.hasResources)
  .sort((a, b) => b.totalFiles - a.totalFiles)
  .slice(0, 6);
const visibleMajorGroups = Object.entries(siteData.majors).map(([key, value]) => ({
  key,
  name: value.name,
  groups: value.groups.filter((group) => !group.hidden),
}));
---

<div class="home-portal">
  <section class="portal-hero" aria-labelledby="portal-title">
    <div class="portal-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">AHU · SBI STUDY INDEX</p>
      <h1 id="portal-title">课程资料，<span>按学习路径抵达</span></h1>
      <p class="portal-hero__lead">
        不必在层层文件夹里碰运气。输入课程名称或代码，再按专业、学期和资料类型缩小范围。
      </p>

      <form class="hero-search" action={sitePath('courses/')} method="get" role="search">
        <label for="home-course-search">查找课程</label>
        <div class="hero-search__control">
          <input
            id="home-course-search"
            name="q"
            type="search"
            placeholder="例如：数据库、YJ40206、194"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <button type="submit">开始查找</button>
        </div>
        <p>支持中文课程名、AHU 课程代码和 ENG 课程代码</p>
      </form>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="primary-action" href={sitePath('courses/')}>浏览全部课程</a>
        <a class="secondary-action" href={siteData.repositoryUrl}>打开资料仓库 ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="coverage-card" aria-label="资料库概览">
      <div class="coverage-card__topline">
        <span>资料覆盖率</span>
        <strong>{availableRate}%</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="coverage-meter" aria-hidden="true">
        <span style={`width: ${availableRate}%`}></span>
      </div>
      <dl class="stat-grid">
        <div>
          <dt>课程建档</dt>
          <dd>{siteData.stats.courses}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>已有资料</dt>
          <dd>{siteData.stats.coursesWithResources}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>索引文件</dt>
          <dd>{siteData.stats.files}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>专业方向</dt>
          <dd>{siteData.stats.majors}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p>库存来自仓库真实文件，空目录不会被计入。</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="portal-section" aria-labelledby="major-path-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">按培养方案进入</p>
        <h2 id="major-path-title">从正在读的学期开始</h2>
      </div>
      <p>每个学期直接显示已有资料的课程数量，减少无效点击。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="major-path-grid">
      {visibleMajorGroups.map((major) => (
        <article class={`major-path major-path--${major.key.toLowerCase()}`}>
          <div class="major-path__header">
            <span class="major-monogram">{major.key}</span>
            <div>
              <h3>{major.name.replace(`（${major.key}）`, '')}</h3>
              <p>{major.key === 'DMT' ? '技术、设计与信息系统' : '数学、统计与数据分析'}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="semester-list">
            {major.groups.map((group) => (
              <li>
                <span>{group.name}</span>
                <small>{group.availableCourses}/{group.courses.length} 门有资料</small>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href={sitePath(`curricula/${major.key.toLowerCase()}/`)}>
            查看 {major.key} 完整课表 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="portal-section" aria-labelledby="resource-rich-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--inline">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">快速抵达</p>
        <h2 id="resource-rich-title">资料较丰富的课程</h2>
      </div>
      <a href={sitePath('courses/?status=available&sort=resources')}>查看全部 →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="course-preview-grid">
      {topCourses.map((course) => (
        <a class="course-preview" href={coursePath(course.slug)}>
          <div class="course-preview__meta">
            <span>{course.displayCode || '专题课程'}</span>
            <strong>{course.totalFiles} 个文件</strong>
          </div>
          <h3>{course.name}</h3>
          <p>{course.categories.map((category) => `${category.name} ${category.count}`).join(' · ')}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="portal-note" aria-label="项目说明">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">学生共同维护</p>
      <h2>找得到，也更容易补充</h2>
      <p>发现课程信息有误或资料缺失？阅读贡献指南，让下一位同学少走一点弯路。</p>
    </div>
    <a href={sitePath('contribute/')}>如何参与贡献</a>
  </section>
</div>
